Spec: Immutable public connection status

Purpose:
  Share the exact connection status semantics with Java while remaining independent of platform authority and transport.

Owns:
  ./ConnectionStatus.cs

References:
  /contracts/java/src/main/java/dev/linkgate/contracts/ConnectionStatus.sdd
  /docs/adr/0024-public-connection-lifecycle.md

Must:
  Restrict UTC years to 0001 through 9999 and reject leap seconds or 24-hour rollover normalization.
  Parse at most 16 KiB of strict UTF8 JSON with exactly the 17 documented fields and canonical lowercase identifiers.
  Represent byte counts as uint64 decimal strings, generation as positive uint64, and UTC timestamps as exact milliseconds.
  Distinguish selected and business paths; reject impossible lifecycle, counter, completion, timestamp and fixed-error combinations.
  Expose immutable typed values and fresh wire snapshots without performing IO or claiming any platform authorization.
